  "ingredients": [
    "2/3 ounce pork rinds",
    "2 large egg",
    "2 tablespoon heavy cream",
    "1 teaspoon maple extract",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "2 tablespoon coconut oil (for frying)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pork-rind-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-53601-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Pork-Rind-Pancakes-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grind up the pork rinds in a blender or food processor until you get a smooth powder.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pork-rind-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-53601-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Pork-Rind-Pancakes-2.png"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the eggs, heavy cream, maple extract, and cinnamon to the blender. Blend again until you get a smooth consistency.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pork-rind-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-53601-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Pork-Rind-Pancakes-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn the stovetop on medium heat and add some of the coconut oil to a pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pork-rind-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-53601-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Pork-Rind-Pancakes-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the batter into the frying pan. Keep an eye out for bubbles forming in the middle and the edges looking cooked.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pork-rind-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-53601-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Pork-Rind-Pancakes-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Flip onto the other side and continue cooking, making sure the pancake is fully cooked. Repeat this process with the rest of the batter, adding coconut oil as needed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pork-rind-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-53601-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Pork-Rind-Pancakes-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pork-rind-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-53601-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
